WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:09.920
<v Narrator><i>Eurylochus persuades the crew to sacrifice the best cattle rather than starve.</i>

2
00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:22.690
<v Narrator><i>Eurylochus substitute oak leaves for barley and water for wine, kill the animals, and roast the meat.</i>

3
00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:29.980
<v Narrator><i>The hides crawl and the meat bellows on the spits.</i>

4
00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:37.990
<v Narrator><i>Lampetie tells Helios, who demands punishment from Zeus.</i>
